// ---------- adding images ----------
// v3.69 (capture-stacking): a picture with no place given goes to the nearest free place to the middle of the view (the
// overlap test V.placeChildren uses): there if nothing is in the way, else just to the right of what is in the way, else
// just below it, whichever is nearer (a step down costs a little more than a step right, so captures form a row). Three
// captures in a row no longer sit on top of each other, and the view follows one that lands off screen. w × hh is the
// room wanted (a block of pictures added at once, addFiles); the result is the centre of the block's first picture.
