  rsel: "Select (M): drag a box round the part to change. The arrow beside it has Lasso (L), Polygon (P) and Brush (B)",
  lasso: "Lasso (L): draw round the part to change. The arrow beside it has the other shapes",
  poly: "Polygon (P): click the corners, double-click or Enter to close. The arrow beside it has the other shapes",
